4,1,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I think we should be careful about how these programs are sustained long-term. Could we look into our previous collaborations and current staffing?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It would be wise to see if previous trials actually yielded results before we commit to a new direction.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We should also consider the actual burden on the staff. A program is only as good as the people available to run it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Let's be realistic. We often forget that initial funding isn't the same as operational costs. I want to see the actual budget and potential revenue.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see such passion. I only worry if our dear hospital can physically hold more. Perhaps we should check the rooms and booking systems?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, that's a great point. If we don't have the space, the program will fail regardless of the budget.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If we divide the data sources, we can cover all these bases efficiently. I'll focus on the outcomes of previous trials.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look into the staffing reviews. I want to know who is actually available to take on more work.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll handle the financial side. I'm interested in the ledger and the regional tariffs to see what we actually earn back.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the physical capacity then. I want to make sure our patients and staff aren't too crowded.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the board minutes and the data agreements. I want to see where our previous joint efforts might have faltered.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,That sounds comprehensive. I'll stick to the readmission figures and the nursing round completion to see what worked.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll also check the ward vacancies. It's important to know where the agency cover is highest.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Fine. Just ensure you aren't ignoring the cost of those ""successful"" trials. Efficiency is nothing without solvency.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,Let us all be kind to one another as we search. I will check the rooms and the booking system records.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I think we have a good plan. Let's gather the information and meet back here.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. I look forward to seeing the evidence.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll be ready.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
